{"seq":2,"slug":"envoy-performance-tuning","title":"代理性能调优：缓冲区、连接池、并发与内存吞吐优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/observability-performance-ops/envoy-performance-tuning","wordCount":3163,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"代理性能调优-缓冲区-连接池-并发与内存吞吐优化\">代理性能调优：缓冲区、连接池、并发与内存吞吐优化</h1><p>某跨境电商网关在旺季把上游 5xx 从 0.2% 压到 0.02% 之后，却出现了新的症状：单 Pod 内存从 300MB 爬到 2.1GB，然后被 OOMKilled。抓 profile 发现 90% 的内存挂在 <code>Buffer::OwnedImpl</code> 上——不是代码泄漏，而是 Envoy 默认的 1MiB per-connection buffer 乘上几万条连接。这类问题不会在压测曲线的 QPS 上显示出来，只会在地毯式扩容后集中爆发。Envoy 的性能调优本质上是在四个彼此耦合的旋钮之间找平衡：缓冲区、连接池（熔断器）、并发、过载保护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四个旋钮与它们的耦合关系\">核心概念：四个旋钮与它们的耦合关系</h2><p>调优前必须先建立&quot;钱花在哪&quot;的模型。一条请求在 Envoy 里穿过四层资源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>主要配置面</th>\n<th>调错的典型症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓冲区</td>\n<td>单连接的读/写字节上限</td>\n<td><code>per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes</code>（listener / cluster）</td>\n<td>内存飙升 → OOMKilled，或反压丢失 → 上游被击穿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接池</td>\n<td>到上游的连接与在途请求数</td>\n<td><code>circuit_breakers</code>（CDS）</td>\n<td>队列积压 → P99 陡增；或过早 503 → 误熔断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td>worker 线程与在途 stream 数</td>\n<td><code>--concurrency</code>、<code>max_concurrent_streams</code></td>\n<td>单 worker 热点 → 长尾抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过载保护</td>\n<td>系统级资源压力（堆/CPU/连接数）</td>\n<td><code>overload_manager</code>（bootstrap）</td>\n<td>雪崩，拒绝策略完全不生效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四个旋钮不是独立的。缓冲区放大直接抬高内存水位，因而决定过载保护阈值该设在哪儿；并发数决定连接池的 <code>max_connections</code> 该开多大；连接池排队又反过来让缓冲区长时间持有数据。把它们当成一个闭环来调，才不会按下葫芦浮起瓢。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Down[&quot;下游客户端&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;字节流&quot;| LBuf[&quot;listener 连接缓冲&lt;br/&gt;默认 1MiB/连接&quot;]&#10;  LBuf --&gt; Worker[&quot;worker 线程&lt;br/&gt;--concurrency&quot;]&#10;  Worker --&gt; CB{&quot;熔断器&lt;br/&gt;max_connections / max_pending_requests&quot;}&#10;  CB --&gt;|&quot;队列满&quot;| Reject[&quot;503 / 排队&quot;]&#10;  CB --&gt;|&quot;放行&quot;| Pool[&quot;上游连接池&quot;]&#10;  Pool --&gt; UBuf[&quot;cluster 连接缓冲&lt;br/&gt;默认 1MiB/连接&quot;]&#10;  UBuf --&gt; Up[&quot;上游服务&quot;]&#10;  OM[&quot;overload_manager&lt;br/&gt;堆 / CPU 压力&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;超阈值削峰&quot;| Worker&#10;  OM -.-&gt;|&quot;shrink_heap / reset_stream&quot;| UBuf\">graph TD\n  Down[\"下游客户端\"] --&gt;|\"字节流\"| LBuf[\"listener 连接缓冲&lt;br/&gt;默认 1MiB/连接\"]\n  LBuf --&gt; Worker[\"worker 线程&lt;br/&gt;--concurrency\"]\n  Worker --&gt; CB{\"熔断器&lt;br/&gt;max_connections / max_pending_requests\"}\n  CB --&gt;|\"队列满\"| Reject[\"503 / 排队\"]\n  CB --&gt;|\"放行\"| Pool[\"上游连接池\"]\n  Pool --&gt; UBuf[\"cluster 连接缓冲&lt;br/&gt;默认 1MiB/连接\"]\n  UBuf --&gt; Up[\"上游服务\"]\n  OM[\"overload_manager&lt;br/&gt;堆 / CPU 压力\"] -.-&gt;|\"超阈值削峰\"| Worker\n  OM -.-&gt;|\"shrink_heap / reset_stream\"| UBuf</pre><p>这张图的读法：缓冲区在两端各占一份，连接池是中间那道闸门，而过载管理器是压在所有组件之上的紧急阀。下面逐个展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓冲区-per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes-与水位线\">缓冲区：per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes 与水位线</h2><p>Envoy 声称自己没有阻塞，代价是把所有&quot;发不完的数据&quot;放进内存缓冲。每个连接的读缓冲与写缓冲合起来受一个<strong>软限制</strong>约束，即 <code>per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes</code>，listener 和 cluster 各有一个同名字段。官方文档给出的默认值是 <strong>1MiB</strong>，原文是&quot;If unspecified, an implementation defined default is applied (1MiB)&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/listener/v3/listener.proto\">listener.proto</a>、<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/cluster.proto\">cluster.proto</a>）。</p>\n<p>1MiB 是&quot;够用不炸&quot;的折中，但它对不可信的下游是灾难。假如一个 Pod 承载 2 万条并发连接、每条都触到上限，理论上限是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>MiB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>19.5</mn><mtext>GiB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20000 \\times 1\\text{MiB} = 19.5\\text{GiB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MiB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GiB</span></span></span></span></span></span>——远超任何容器配额。Envoy 官方 Edge 最佳实践给出的对策很直接：<strong>把 listener 和 cluster 的 per-connection buffer 都显式设为 32768（32KiB）</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/configuration/best_practices/edge\">edge best practices</a>）。</p>\n<p>缓冲区的内存风险可以用一个简单模型估算。设并发连接数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、单连接缓冲上限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、平均填充率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\in (0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{buffer}} \\approx N \\cdot B \\cdot \\rho \\times 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>乘 2 是因为读写缓冲可能同时填充，而在慢上游场景下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 会趋近 1。这个式子解释了为什么&quot;压测只测 QPS&quot;会漏掉内存问题：QPS 高时请求快进快出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 很低；真正的杀手是<strong>慢连接 + 高并发</strong>——上游超时、客户端 4G 弱网、SSE 长连接。</p>\n<p>缓冲区还通过<strong>水位线（watermark）<strong>驱动反压。当缓冲填充越过 high watermark，Envoy 会停止从对端读取 socket（HTTP/2 里则发 WINDOW_UPDATE 减窗），从而把压力传导回客户端。listener 上的 <code>per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes</code> 还配套一个 <strong>high watermark 超时</strong>：<code>high_watermark_timeout</code> 若未设或为 0，则连接</strong>不会</strong>仅因为长期高于水位线而被关闭——即超时默认禁用。对可能被慢客户端堵住的路径，显式设一个非零超时能避免连接无限期占内存。</p>\n<p>一个常见误区是&quot;缓冲给得越大吞吐越好&quot;。实际上缓冲只吸收<strong>抖动</strong>，不增加<strong>速率</strong>：链路带宽由上下游决定，过大的缓冲只会把&quot;背压&quot;推迟成&quot;内存&quot;和&quot;超时&quot;，反而拉长尾延迟。经验法则是——<strong>B 取&quot;一条往返时间内可能到达的字节量&quot;的 1.5 倍左右</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\approx 1.5 \\cdot BW \\cdot RTT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以跨境链路 50Mbps、RTT 200ms 为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.25</mn><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BW \\cdot RTT \\approx 1.25\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span>，取 2MB 已足够；而跨洲 300ms 场景需要重新评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断器-连接池的闸门与排队\">熔断器：连接池的闸门与排队</h2><p>Envoy 到上游的<strong>连接池</strong>不是无限扩张的，控制它的就是每个 cluster 的 <code>circuit_breakers</code>。这些字段有明确的默认值（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/circuit_breaker.proto\">circuit_breaker.proto</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>调优方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>max_connections</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>Envoy 向上游集群建立的最大连接数</td>\n<td>按上游承载能力下调，如 100–500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_pending_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>等待空闲连接的最大排队请求数</td>\n<td>与上游队列深度匹配，避免&quot;缓冲式雪崩&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>最大并行请求数（HTTP/2 多路复用时生效）</td>\n<td>≥ <code>max_connections</code>，gRPC 场景要放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_retries</code></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>最大并行重试数</td>\n<td>默认 3 常偏大，大促期应降到 1–2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_connection_pools</code></td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>单个 cluster 允许的连接池数</td>\n<td>一般不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>track_remaining</code></td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>是否上报&quot;剩余可用配额&quot;指标</td>\n<td>排障期建议置 true</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个阈值里最容易踩坑的是 <code>max_pending_requests</code>。它是<strong>队列</strong>，不是<strong>拒绝</strong>：请求进队列后，超出 <code>max_connection_pool_timeout</code>（默认不设，即无限等待）才失败。默认 1024 的排队深度足以把一次上游抖动放大成一次级联超时——请求在队列里等了几秒，客户端早已超时重发，队列里的旧请求还在占用连接配额。大促期把它压到 20–50，让 Envoy 早拒绝、让上游和客户端早退避，整体成功率反而更高。</p>\n<p><code>max_retries</code> 默认 3 是另一个放大器。三条并行重试意味着一次失败最多变成 4 倍的上游压力，在&quot;上游只是慢而非挂&quot;的场景下，重试会亲手把它拖垮。Envoy 提供了 <code>retry_budget</code> 来治本：<code>budget_percent</code> 默认 <strong>20%</strong>（相对当前 active + pending 请求数）、<code>min_retry_concurrency</code> 默认 <strong>3</strong>、<code>budget_interval</code> 默认 <strong>0ms</strong>（只统计当前窗口）。一旦配置 <code>retry_budget</code>，它会<strong>覆盖</strong> <code>max_retries</code>。也就是说，重试预算把&quot;每个请求最多重试几次&quot;换成了&quot;整体重试比例封顶&quot;，这是更贴合真实容量约束的模型。</p>\n<p>熔断阈值还支持<strong>按优先级（priority）分级</strong>：DEFAULT、HIGH、以及健康检查等。若某优先级未配置阈值，会回落到默认值；重复的优先级只取第一条。需要保证关键流量优先通行的场景，可以给 HIGH 优先级更宽松的阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发-worker-池-多路复用与自适应限流\">并发：worker 池、多路复用与自适应限流</h2><p>并发这一层有两个方向：进程内的 worker 线程数，和单连接上的 stream 数。</p>\n<p><strong>worker 线程数</strong>由 <code>--concurrency</code> 决定，本质是 listener 的 <code>SO_REUSEPORT</code> 多队列。容器环境下有个硬性经验：<strong><code>--concurrency</code> 必须等于 CPU limit 的整数部分</strong>，而不是节点核数。Pod 限 4 核而节点 64 核时，按节点起 64 个 worker 会让上下文切换吃掉大量 CPU。worker 与连接生命周期的关系（一条连接绑定一个 worker 直到关闭）在 <a href=\"../envoy-architecture-data-plane/envoy-thread-model-connection-lifecycle\">线程模型与连接生命周期</a> 里有完整推导，这里只强调它对性能的推论：<strong>单条 HTTP/2 长连接的全部流量只落在一个 worker 上</strong>，因此 gRPC 这种&quot;连接少但长寿&quot;的拓扑极易造成 worker 间负载偏斜。</p>\n<p><strong>单连接 stream 数</strong>由协议选项控制。默认值大得惊人（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/core/v3/protocol.proto\">protocol.proto</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>Envoy 默认</th>\n<th>Edge 推荐</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP/2 <code>max_concurrent_streams</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>单连接并行 stream 上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/2 <code>initial_stream_window_size</code></td>\n<td>16 MiB</td>\n<td>64 KiB</td>\n<td>单 stream 流控软上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/2 <code>initial_connection_window_size</code></td>\n<td>24 MiB</td>\n<td>1 MiB</td>\n<td>单连接流控窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/3 <code>max_concurrent_streams</code></td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>QUIC 默认已较小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>默认的 16 MiB stream window 是&quot;高吞吐局域网&quot;取向：它允许单条 stream 缓冲 16MB 不反压。放到跨境公网环境下，这个窗口会让内存被少数慢 stream 吃掉，且放大了队头阻塞的代价。Edge 最佳实践把 stream window 收到 <strong>64KiB</strong>、connection window 收到 <strong>1MiB</strong>，正是为了把内存占用和延迟抖动一起压下来。</p>\n<p><strong>自适应并发（adaptive concurrency）</strong> 是 2024 年后逐步成熟的动态方案。它用 gradient 控制器根据实测 RTT 自动调 <code>max_concurrency</code>（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/configuration/http/http_filters/adaptive_concurrency_filter\">adaptive concurrency filter</a>）。核心公式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">gradient = \\frac{minRTT + B}{sampleRTT}, \\quad B = minRTT \\cdot buffer\\_pct</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">limit_{new} = gradient \\cdot limit_{old} + \\sqrt{limit_{old}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">imi</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">imi</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.2339em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0061em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">imi</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9661em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2339em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>minRTT</code> 通过周期性把并发钉在 <code>min_concurrency</code> 上测出（默认测量并发为 3，并有 <code>jitter</code> 错开各主机的测量窗口，避免全部主机同时降速）；<code>sampleRTT</code> 是窗口内延迟的分位数（默认 p90）。headroom 项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{limit_{old}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1828em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">imi</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 固定不可配，作用是让延迟接近最优时并发能自增长。使用时要注意两点：一是 minRTT 测量窗口内会多出 503，必须配重试（推荐 <code>previous_hosts</code> 谓词）；二是该 filter 必须放在健康检查 filter <strong>之后</strong>，否则健康检查流量会被采样进去。它适用于&quot;上游容量未知且会漂移&quot;的场景，与固定熔断阈值是互补而非替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过载保护与内存-把最后一道阀装上\">过载保护与内存：把最后一道阀装上</h2><p>前面三层调好之后，仍需要一个兜底的系统级阀——<code>overload_manager</code>（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/configuration/operations/overload_manager/overload_manager\">overload manager</a>）。它在 bootstrap 里配置，由<strong>资源监视器</strong>（resource monitor）产出 0–1 的压力值，再触发<strong>过载动作</strong>或<strong>负载卸载点</strong>。</p>\n<p>资源监视器包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监视器</th>\n<th>压力定义</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>envoy.resource_monitors.fixed_heap</code></td>\n<td>当前堆 / <code>max_heap_size_bytes</code></td>\n<td>示例 2 GiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>envoy.resource_monitors.cgroup_memory</code></td>\n<td>用量 / cgroup 限额（取与 <code>max_memory_bytes</code> 的较小值）</td>\n<td>无 cgroup 限额时压力上报为 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>envoy.resource_monitors.cpu_utilization</code></td>\n<td>CPU 使用率</td>\n<td><code>mode: HOST</code> 默认，K8s 用 <code>mode: CONTAINER</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>envoy.resource_monitors.global_downstream_max_connections</code></td>\n<td>无（硬上限）</td>\n<td>示例 1000；未设则无全局限制且启动告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>触发器分 <strong>threshold</strong>（二元，超阈值即饱和）与 <strong>scaled</strong>（<code>scaling_threshold</code> 到 <code>saturation_threshold</code> 之间线性插值）。典型 <code>refresh_interval</code> 是 <strong>0.25s</strong>（K8s 容器示例用 5s）。一组可参考的阈值是：<strong>0.92 触发 HTTP 连接 drain，0.95 停止接受新请求</strong>。</p>\n<p>几个高价值动作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>stop_accepting_requests</code>：立即对新请求返回 503。配合 CPU 监视器时示例用 scaling 0.80 / saturation 0.95。</li>\n<li><code>disable_http_keepalive</code>：对 HTTP/2、HTTP/3 发 GOAWAY 并进入 drain 宽限期；对 HTTP/1 设置 drain 定时器针对空闲连接。注意文档里<strong>没有</strong>单独的 HTTP/2 keepalive 动作——HTTP/2 由这一个动作覆盖。</li>\n<li><code>shrink_heap</code>：周期性把空闲堆还给 OS（配 tcmalloc 尤其有用）。默认 <code>timer_interval: 10s</code>、<code>max_unfreed_memory_bytes: 100MB</code>。</li>\n<li><code>reset_high_memory_stream</code>：仅 HTTP/2，重置高内存 stream。需要 <code>buffer_factory_config.minimum_account_to_track_power_of_two</code>（如 20 表示跟踪 ≥1MiB 的 stream），分 8 个硬编码档位，每次调用每 worker 最多重置 50 条，从最大档开始。</li>\n<li><code>reduce_timeouts</code>：在正常值与最小值之间缩放定时器。</li>\n<li><code>close_idle_http_connections</code>：仅 HTTP/3（QUIC），scaled 时 1 分钟空闲、饱和时收紧到 10 秒。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有一条全局连接数规则值得单独记：<strong><code>global_downstream_max_connections</code> 应设为系统文件描述符上限的一半以下</strong>，给上游连接和文件留出余量。单 listener 也可用 <code>ignore_global_conn_limit</code> 退出全局限制；per-listener 与全局限制独立生效、各自强制执行。</p>\n<p>overload 相关指标落在 <code>overload.&lt;name&gt;.</code> 命名空间下，包括 <code>pressure</code>、<code>failed_updates</code>、<code>active</code>、<code>scale_percent</code>，负载卸载点还有 <code>shed_load_count</code>——排障时先看 <code>pressure</code> 曲线，它通常比客户端错误率更早暴露问题。</p>\n<p>最后回到开头那个 OOM 案例。正确的修法是组合拳：<code>per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes</code> 从 1MiB 降到 32KiB（内存上限直接砍到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>32</mn><mtext>KiB</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mtext>GiB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20000 \\times 32\\text{KiB} \\times 2 \\approx 1.2\\text{GiB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KiB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GiB</span></span></span></span></span></span>，仍在配额边缘，需继续压连接数），<code>global_downstream_max_connections</code> 按 FD 上限的一半封顶，<code>overload_manager</code> 在堆压力 0.95 时 <code>shrink_heap</code>。缓冲区配置与过滤器链的实例化顺序相互影响，扩展点开销见 <a href=\"../http-connection-filter-extensibility/filter-chain-extension-mechanism\">过滤器链扩展机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>调优的次序建议从外到内，每一步都用指标验证再进下一步：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>先定连接数上限</strong>：<code>global_downstream_max_connections</code> ≈ FD 上限 / 2，per-listener 可加更紧的 <code>max_connections</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>再压缓冲区</strong>：listener 与 cluster 的 <code>per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes</code> 都从 1MiB 降到 32KiB 量级，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\approx 1.5 \\cdot BW \\cdot RTT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 校验是否够用；给 <code>high_watermark_timeout</code> 设一个非零值防慢连接积压。</li>\n<li><strong>再收紧熔断器</strong>：<code>max_pending_requests</code> 从 1024 降到 20–50，<code>max_retries</code> 降到 1–2 或改用 <code>retry_budget</code>（默认 20% 预算）；用 <code>track_remaining</code> 观察剩余配额。</li>\n<li><strong>再对并发</strong>：<code>--concurrency</code> 等于 CPU limit 整数部分；HTTP/2 <code>max_concurrent_streams</code> 从 1024 收到 100，window 从 16MiB/24MiB 收到 64KiB/1MiB；上游容量未知时叠加 adaptive concurrency（注意重试与 filter 顺序）。</li>\n<li><strong>最后装兜底</strong>：<code>overload_manager</code> 用 <code>fixed_heap</code> 或 <code>cgroup_memory</code> + <code>cpu_utilization</code>（K8s 用 CONTAINER 模式），阈值参考 0.92 drain、0.95 stop，动作配 <code>shrink_heap</code> 与 <code>reset_high_memory_stream</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>用指标闭环</strong>：<code>overload.&lt;name&gt;.pressure</code>、连接池的 pending 队列长度、worker 间流量偏斜、缓冲水位线命中次数——这四个指标能覆盖上面绝大部分错误的根因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>记住一条判断原则：<strong>Envoy 的每个&quot;缓冲/队列/重试&quot;默认值都是为通用场景留的余量，而在大促这类极端流量下，余量本身就是风险</strong>。调优不是把参数调大，而是把不确定性收敛到可观测、可回退的范围里。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代理性能调优：缓冲区、连接池、并发与内存吞吐优化","id":"代理性能调优-缓冲区-连接池-并发与内存吞吐优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四个旋钮与它们的耦合关系","id":"核心概念-四个旋钮与它们的耦合关系"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲区：per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes 与水位线","id":"缓冲区-per_connection_buffer_limit_bytes-与水位线"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断器：连接池的闸门与排队","id":"熔断器-连接池的闸门与排队"},{"level":2,"text":"并发：worker 池、多路复用与自适应限流","id":"并发-worker-池-多路复用与自适应限流"},{"level":2,"text":"过载保护与内存：把最后一道阀装上","id":"过载保护与内存-把最后一道阀装上"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Envoy 可观测性模型：Stats 指标命名、Access Log 与链路追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/observability-performance-ops/envoy-observability-model"},"next":{"title":"生产运维与升级治理：版本升级、配置灰度与 CVE 应急","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/observability-performance-ops/envoy-production-upgrade-governance"}}